    "detailed_description": "WASarD is a rogue-lite single stick shooter. Maneuver your auto-casting wizard between dangerous enemies and hundreds of projectiles. Purchase passive charms, unlock permanent wards, and use powerful relics to give yourself an edge in each new randomly generated dungeon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use clever positioning to create escape routes during battles.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151870/extras/f2a9858d890475cd7cc80288387075f2.poster.avif?t=1739469278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151870/extras/f2a9858d890475cd7cc80288387075f2.webm?t=1739469278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151870/extras/f2a9858d890475cd7cc80288387075f2.mp4?t=1739469278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your skills against challenging bosses.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151870/extras/d87c16e02619725c02606ab61cfbdec2.poster.avif?t=1739469278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151870/extras/d87c16e02619725c02606ab61cfbdec2.webm?t=1739469278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151870/extras/d87c16e02619725c02606ab61cfbdec2.mp4?t=1739469278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose carefully as you purchase charms and upgrades.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151870/extras/ac18636a63318a9224a497ad0dd61018.poster.avif?t=1739469278\" ><source src